  "notes": [
    "Admission requires exact saved evidence replay, >=1% endpoint512 flips in all seeds, >=10 flip-hands in each seat and holdout per seed, pooled positive all seeds, and holdout positive in at least2/3 seeds.",
    "Exact replay passed all 13824 saved rows. Endpoint512 candidate-path flip rates were only0.764-0.842%; positive pooled deltas were carried by21-28 nonzero-outcome hands per1152. Seed2 seat1 had only8 flip-hands. Preregistered support gate failed despite pooled3/3 and holdout2/3 positive."
